89
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,080
Part two.

90
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:05,039
Movie and TV tributes.

91
00:03:05,939 --> 00:03:09,180
Rockstar loves pop culture, and this time the

92
00:03:09,180 --> 00:03:12,659
references are hiding in garages, trunks and apartment

93
00:03:12,659 --> 00:03:13,280
