Number five.

95
00:03:15,419 --> 00:03:16,340
Paul Walker's car.

96
00:03:16,979 --> 00:03:19,599
In a villa garage on Vespucci Island, in

97
00:03:19,599 --> 00:03:22,900
Vice City, players found a green Maibatsu Penumbra

98
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:23,340
F F.

99
