111
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:52,680
Number six.

112
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,139
The snake in the trunk.

113
00:03:54,699 --> 00:03:56,319
Rockstar did not stop there.

114
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,159
If you open the trunk of that car,

115
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,439
