127
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,120
Number seven.

128
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,540
Dexter's apartment.

129
00:04:31,540 --> 00:04:34,439
Fans of the show Dexter spotted a building

130
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:37,360
