But the community is convinced, and honestly, it

134
00:04:47,579 --> 00:04:49,500
is hard to argue with them after number

135
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:49,939
eight.

136
00:04:50,819 --> 00:04:51,259
Number eight.

137
00:04:51,459 --> 00:04:52,519
The kill kit and the boat.

138
00:04:53,019 --> 00:04:55,220
Players who explored the area reported finding a

139
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:56,759
