140
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:57,920
Dexter's signature kit.

141
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,759
And nearby, there is a boat that looks

142
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:01,279
just like his boat from the show, the

143
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:01,920
Slice of Life.

144
00:05:02,339 --> 00:05:03,759
Players say you can even steal it.

145
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:05,100
Rockstar has said nothing.

146
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,420
Which, for Rockstar, is basically a wink.

147
