151
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:17,779
Before we keep going, if you are enjoying

152
00:05:17,779 --> 00:05:18,899
this, subscribe.

153
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,439
It is free, and it tells me to

154
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,579
keep making these.

155
00:05:22,579 --> 00:05:23,920
Part three.

156
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:26,040
Rockstar's own history.

157
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:29,019
GTA 6 is full of little winks to

158
00:05:29,019 --> 00:05:31,139
the games that came before it.

159
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:32,379
Number nine.

160
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:33,100
Michael's boat.

161
00:05:33,459 --> 00:05:34,860
This one started before launch.

162
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:37,339
In the second trailer, fans spotted a white

163
00:05:37,339 --> 00:05:40,100
