179
00:06:09,019 --> 00:06:09,959
But it is a fun one.

180
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:11,839
And if it is true, it means the

181
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:14,660
worlds of GTA 5 and GTA 6 are

182
00:06:14,660 --> 00:06:16,420
connected by one stolen boat.

183
00:06:17,139 --> 00:06:17,860
Number ten.

184
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:18,860
Red Dead money.

185
00:06:19,339 --> 00:06:20,819
