195
00:06:38,779 --> 00:06:40,259
Rockstar has never confirmed it.

196
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:41,540
But it never had to.

197
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:42,959
Number eleven.

198
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,259
A boat called Leonida.

199
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,920
