203
00:06:53,339 --> 00:06:54,680
And one of them is The Leonida.

204
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:57,540
Red Dead 2 came out in 2018, long

205
00:06:57,540 --> 00:06:59,500
before anyone knew the name of GTA 6's

206
00:06:59,500 --> 00:06:59,839
state.

207
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:01,199
Was it a planned tease?

208
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:03,019
Some say yes, others say it is a

209
00:07:03,019 --> 00:07:03,379
