210
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,879
Either way, it is a wild find.

211
00:07:06,819 --> 00:07:07,439
Number twelve.

212
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:08,800
The Vercetti Estate.

213
00:07:09,259 --> 00:07:10,740
This is not a fan theory.

214
00:07:11,199 --> 00:07:12,839
