00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:26,800
The Vercetti Estate was Tommy Vercetti's mansion in

220
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,139
GTA Vice City.

221
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,860
It was where he ran his empire, and

222
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:33,420
