223
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:36,420
Tommy is not in GTA 6.

224
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:39,259
But his house, it seems, never left.

225
00:07:39,259 --> 00:07:42,199
For anyone who played the original Vice City,

226
00:07:42,459 --> 00:07:45,139
that single line in a product description says

227
00:07:45,139 --> 00:07:45,720
a lot.

228
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:47,480
Number thirteen.

229
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,920
Games inside the game.

230
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:50,860
Your safehouse is not just a place to

231
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:51,180
