241
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:11,379
Part four.

242
00:08:11,779 --> 00:08:13,300
Leonida's wild side.

243
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:17,600
Leonida is Rockstar's version of Florida, and Florida

244
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,959
